<div class="comment"><div class="commtext c00">Pretty sure you’re losing vital information from cross-session contex. You may be able to work longer in a single session, but Claude will degrade without even the mundane details. It’s like doing math without showing your work.</div><div class="reply"><p><font size="1"></font></div></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr class="athing comtr" id="47205937"><td><table border="0"><tr><td class="ind" indent="0"><img src="s.gif" height="1" width="0"></td><td valign="top" class="votelinks"><center><a id='up_47205937' href='vote?id=47205937&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D47193064'><div class='votearrow' title='upvote'></div></a></center></td><td class="default"><div style="margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;"><span class="comhead"><a href="user?id=theusus" class="hnuser">theusus</a> <span class="age" title="2026-03-01T11:58:30 1772366310"><a href="item?id=47205937">5 months ago</a></span> <span id="unv_47205937"></span><span class="navs"> | <a href="#47208899" class="clicky" aria-hidden="true">prev</a> | <a href="#47202743" class="clicky" aria-hidden="true">next</a> <a class="togg clicky" id="47205937" n="1" href="javascript:void(0)">[–]</a><span class="onstory"></span></span></span></div><br>
